# Ignore everything on scratch by default, except the provided examples
/*
!.gitignore

!nested-subdir/
!subdir/
!scratch-simulator.cc
!CMakeLists.txt

# The validation harness is NOT scratch work. `/*` above matches this directory,
# and because git does not descend into an ignored directory, every new file
# under it was silently untracked -- verify_causal_sim.py itself needed `git add
# -f`. A validation harness that can quietly not exist is a worse failure mode
# than anything it checks for, so the directory is un-ignored wholesale rather
# than file by file, and verify_causal_sim.py fails if anything under it is
# untracked.
!python_handoff/
